              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Repository plus title, then Enter. Where you start sets the defaults. Two shapes are drawn for the main question: Variant A is a quick capture that expands into the full set of fields (H1–H3), Variant B is one full form from the start (H4). Templates, project and sub-issue defaults, and a rejected creation follow.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
