                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The desktop app's only screen before signing in (the web goes from the landing page straight to GitHub). It explains up front what GitHub will ask for and that the data stays on this computer. Enter or the button asks GitHub for a code and moves to S2.",
