                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The status bar already carries everything githq says without being asked (how fresh a screen is, edits sending or failed), so “update ready” joins it there. The last segment's right end holds it in every layout: sidebar collapsed, item in a modal or on its own page. Restart and Later are also commands in ⌘K.",
