              "fill": "$fg-3",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 820,
              "content": "Every issue, label and project field stays on GitHub, where your code and your contributors already are. githq doesn’t import, mirror or own any of it — it just makes working it feel instant. Every change you make here is an ordinary GitHub change, on github.com the same second.",
