                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "GWKWz",
                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A marker can stay on for weeks, so it never moves, pulses or grows. It has two levels, computed from GitHub's data with nothing stored: bright for a break younger than 24 hours, quiet after that. It stays red either way and never goes away until a run passes. The marker sits on the repository's icon, so markers line up in one column and the open-items count beside the name stays. Zero is shown only once every tracked repository has been read.",
