                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "→ unfolds a workflow in place and ← folds it, so there's no extra page and the strip stays in view. These runs are read on demand, so this is one of the few places a wait can appear: known rows show at once and the rest arrive below. J and K walk into the runs, Enter opens one, and F narrows by ref, typed or picked. Runs started by a pull request are listed here too.",
