              "id": "Vtt0e",
              "name": "Group note",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "One screen with four sections: Repositories, Projects, Saving to GitHub, Account. Keys 1 to 4 switch between them, and it opens from the menu on the signed-in user, the command menu or the , key. It is the only place to start tracking. The account stays a section rather than a page of its own, so the user menu needs one entry and there is one place to look. An organisation that hides its private data stays visible next to both lists and in Account.",
