                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "X on a collapsed entry selects it whole, and the palette's chip counts pull requests since edits apply to them. ⇧J crosses a collapsed entry in one step and an expanded one row by row. X on one row inside selects just that one, and the entry shows a half mark.",
