              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Where am I in this stack, and how does the rest stand? It never scrolls away, so J and K only change what's highlighted. It's the same content in all three ways an item opens: which one is open, each one's state, K and J on its neighbours, what stops the stack, and the merge.",
